  "title": {
   "en": "I became a civil servant in a magical world"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "이세계 마법 공무원이 되었다"
   },
   {
    "en": "Becoming a Mage of the Special Unit in Another World"
   },
   {
    "en": "Becoming a Special Unit Mage in Another World"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Became a Magic Civil Servant in Another World"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"Monday? Hate it. Tuesday? Hate it. And what I hate the most? Going to work.\"\nThe civil servant Hae Sunal feels this way. In his previous life, all he wished for was to be able to use magic as normally as anyone else, so he invented a way for it to happen… In his next life. But now that he's in this new life, due to ‘magic’, he’s been living a far noisier life than expected.\n“Hello, I am Hae Sunal, a member of the Special Department for Cross-Species Civil Complaints and Resolution.”"
  },
